","Data_request_download_9":"File format","Data_request_download_account":"Account","Data_request_download_data_format1":"Types of data","Data_request_download_data_format2":"File format","Data_request_download_data_format3":".json","Data_request_download_data_format_acct_info1":"Your account information (e.g. username, bio, contact information)","Data_request_download_data_format_acct_info2":"Your activity (e.g. your posts/comments on chatsbots)","Data_request_download_data_format_acct_info3":"Your agents\' information (e.g. name, description, tools used, background image, settings and parameters)","Data_request_download_data_format_button":"Request data","Data_request_download_data_format_title":"Data types currently supported:","Data_request_download_data_records":"Requested on {date}","Data_request_download_data_volume":"All","Data_request_download_delete_account":"Delete account","Data_request_download_description1":"Request and download your data","Data_request_download_description2":"Request a copy of your data from Coze to back up your account or export it to other services.","Data_request_download_download_button":"Go to download","Data_request_download_download_button_1":"Download","Data_request_download_expire_desc":"If you submit another request, your existing file will expire.","Data_request_download_title":"Download data","Data_request_download_user_data":"User data","Data_request_download_user_info1":"User alias","Data_request_download_user_info2":"User name","Data_request_download_user_info3":"UID","Data_request_download_user_info4":"Phone","Data_request_download_user_info5":"E-mail","Datasets":"Knowledge","Delete":"Delete","Delete_failed":"Delete failed","Delete_success":"Deleted","Description":"Description","Descriptions":"Descriptions","Disabled":"Disabled","Display format":"Display format","Duplicate_success":"Copied","Edit":"Edit","Edit_avater":"Edit avater","Edit_success":"Edit successfully","Edit_time":"Edit time","Edit_time_1":"Edit time","Edit_time_2":"Edit time","Example":"Example","Explore_load_fail":"Load failed","Explore_retry":"Retry","FileboxInfo.Mode":"Filebox","FileboxInfo.Mode.Off":"Off","FileboxInfo.Mode.On":"On","Fold":"Collespe","Force_AI":"AI","Force_I_know":"OK","Force_authorize_agreement_1":"\\"User Agreement\\"","Force_authorize_agreement_2":"\\"Privacy Policy\\"","Force_check_detail":"Pattern exhibition, interactive clock in the collection of exquisite gifts","Force_check_detail_open_tip":"The clock in module will be open {time}, and offline attendees can participate in the clock in activity in the offline exhibition area.","Force_check_in":"The clock in the exhibition area","Force_coze":"Coze welfare broadcast","Force_coze_detail":"Register as a Coze user first and receive a limited-time free template.","Force_coze_detail_tip":"Button is a new generation of AI application development platform. This time, a limited-time free official high-quality template has been prepared for the registration guests of the conference to help more developers develop high-quality AI applications. Hurry up and get it!","Force_coze_go":"Go to pick it up now","Force_coze_tip":"limited time event","Force_experience":"LLM Experience Center","Force_experience_detail":"Experience Doubao model universal assistant, 500,000 tokens for free","Force_experience_tip":"Early Access","Force_front_page":"Home","Force_guide":"Conference Guide","Force_guide_detail":"Quickly understand the conference information","Force_guide_open_detail":"The participation guide will be open {time}, and offline participants can view the conference participation guide.","Force_guide_tip":"First look","Force_guide_tip_time":"The conference guide will be open before the start of the conference","Force_loading":"Loading...","Force_log_in_authorize":"Authorized mobile phone number Quick login","Force_log_in_authorize_please":"Please log in with your mobile number.","Force_log_in_authorize_yes":"I have read and agree","Force_log_in_authorize_yes_again":"Please read and agree to the agreement.","Force_log_in_lose":"Authorizing mobile phone number failed.","Force_log_in_tip":"Welcome to the 2024 Volcano Engine FORCE Original Power Conference Mini Program, please log in with your mobile phone number. Quickly understand the content of the conference and experience AI capabilities immediately!","Force_login_again":"Switch mobile phone number to log in.","Force_my":"My","Force_my_agreement_1":"User Agreement","Force_my_agreement_2":"Privacy Policy","Force_my_agreement_detail_1":"You are welcome to use this Mini Program to participate in the \\"2024 Winter Volcano Engine FORCE Power Conference\\" (referred to as the \\"event\\") hosted by Beijing Volcano Engine Technology Co., Ltd. (\\"we\\"). Special reminder: Before you (hereinafter or \\"user\\") start reading and decide whether to accept the \\"User Agreement\\" (\\"this Agreement\\"), you are specially reminded to read and pay attention to the bold and underlined content in this Agreement. Minor users under the age of 14 are requested to read this Agreement carefully and decide whether to agree to accept this Agreement accompanied by a legal guardian. If you read and agree to the content of this agreement, you can start browsing the event information, registering, and experiencing AI interaction during the event; if you have any questions about this agreement, or cannot accept this agreement in whole or in part, or need to give us feedback (including suggestions, complaints, reports, etc.) during use, you can log in to Volcano Engine \\"Official Website - Pre-Sales/After-Sales - Online Customer Service\\" or choose to call the hotline 400-850-0030 to contact us.\\n\\nThis Agreement is for you to use Mini Program to participate in activities. The content of this Agreement also includes the \\"Personal Information Authorization and Protection Statement\\". We may update this Agreement at any time based on our own judgment on commercial, legal and policy elements; without your affirmative consent, we will not reduce your legal rights under this Agreement.\\nUser Personal Information Security: Protecting your user\'s personal information is one of our basic principles. You agree that we will collect, use, store, manage and protect your user\'s personal information in accordance with the provisions of this Agreement and the Personal Information Authorization and Protection Statement; if you do not agree or cannot accept all or part of the terms of the Personal Information Authorization and Protection Statement or have questions, you can contact us according to the first contact information.\\nUser usage: You agree to use the information and technical services provided under this activity reasonably and lawfully in accordance with the provisions of this agreement. You shall abide by national laws, regulations and policies, and shall not use Mini Program to engage in any illegal activities or violate the rights of third parties. You shall abide by the rules and regulations of the platform, and shall not interfere with or damage the normal operation of Mini Program.\\nIntellectual Property Statement: The intellectual property rights of the event information and other content provided by this Mini Program belong to us or we have been legally authorized. You can only browse the event information and complete the registration through the Mini Program. For the avoidance of doubt, under no circumstances do we transfer part or all of the intellectual property rights to any content under this Mini Program to you. Any pictures, introductions, etc. that you view through this Mini Program cannot be used for any commercial purpose without our written consent.\\nForce Majeure and Other Disclaimers: Users may be affected by the following force majeure or other factors during the use of this Mini Program, including but not limited to: political reasons, social environment, natural disasters, economic crises, computer viruses or hacker attacks, server or system instability, your special location, any technical ability, network quality and communication lines, computer failure (hereinafter collectively referred to as disclaimers). If you suffer losses due to the above disclaimers, we are exempt from liability to the extent permitted by laws and policies.\\nApplicable Law and Dispute Jurisdiction: This User Agreement is governed by the laws of the People\'s Republic of China. Disputes under this User Agreement shall be under the jurisdiction of the court where the defendant is domiciled.\\nAI Interactive Experience: If you use the AI interactive functions provided by this Mini Program, you should abide by the following rules. 7.1 This service relies on generative artificial intelligence models and services to provide you with artificial intelligence generation technology services and other technical services. It is for your reference only. You should not use the output as professional advice, commercial use or for other purposes. You should have recognized that the output generated by artificial intelligence has inherent limitations. Our service may occasionally generate inaccurate information. We take content security seriously and will strive to take reasonable security measures to filter inappropriate content produced by the model. However, we cannot completely rule out the situation that there are still mistakes. If you encounter a relevant situation, you can give us feedback through the aforementioned hotline, and we will accept and deal with it in a timely manner. By using our services, you acknowledge and agree to the following: (1) If it involves a situation that may have a significant impact on you or related parties, it is recommended that you consult relevant professionals. (2) It is your responsibility to evaluate the accuracy and appropriateness of the output of the artificial intelligence model according to your specific needs, including manual review as appropriate before applying or disseminating the output of this service. (3) Any judgment you make based on the content of the output, or subsequent related actions made accordingly, the consequences and liability shall be borne by you, including risks arising from reliance on the authenticity, accuracy, reliability, non-infringement or satisfaction of a particular purpose of the content of the output. You should understand scientifically and rationally and use generative artificial intelligence technology in accordance with the law. (4) The Service may occasionally generate incomplete, incorrect or potentially offensive output, which should not be construed as reflecting our views or positions. In addition, any reference to third-party products or services in the output does not imply our endorsement or association with us. (5) To use this service, you need to prepare your own end point devices (such as computers, mobile phones, etc.). In order to realize the functions of this service, you need to connect the end point devices to the Internet. You understand that you will bear the required costs (such as traffic fees, Internet access fees, etc.). 7.2 User behavior requirements, you should be responsible for the use of this function and related services, unless permitted by law or with our prior written permission, your use of this function and related services shall not have the following acts: 7.2.1 use any plugin, plug-in, system or third-party tools not authorized or licensed by the company to interfere with the normal operation of this service, damage, modify or exert other effects; 7.2.2 use or carry out any behavior that endangers computer cyber security for this service, including but not limited to: (1) illegal intrusion into the network, interference with the normal function of the network, theft of network data and other activities that endanger cyber security; (2) provide special use for intrusion into the network, interference with the normal function of the network and protective measures, theft of network data and other activities that endanger cyber security Programs and tools for security activities; (3) without permission to enter the public computer network or other people\'s computer systems and delete, modify, add stored information; (4) without permission, attempt to probe, scan, test the service or network weaknesses or other acts of disruption to cyber security; (5) attempt to interfere with, disrupt the normal operation of the service, deliberately spread malicious programs or viruses and other acts of disruption and interference with normal network information services; (6) reverse engineering, disassembling, decompiling, translating or otherwise attempting to discover the source code, models, algorithms and systems of the service source code or underlying components; (7) development, service and us and/or affiliates have the possibility of competition Applications, products, services or models; (8) violations of laws and regulations, this Agreement, our relevant rules and other acts that violate the legitimate rights and interests of others. 7.2.3 impersonate another person or gain access to the Service without authorization; 7.2.4 use or engage in fraudulent, fraudulent, misleading or deceptive activities against the Service, including but not limited to impersonation or representation of an agent-generated answer as artificially generated, plagiarism or academic dishonesty, or phishing, and or engage in any other illegal activities; 7.2.5 use the Software and related services in any way that may violate the privacy of any third party, such as illegally collecting or disclosing personally identifiable information or educational, financial or other protected records, such as addresses, phone numbers, email addresses, numbers and features in personal identification documents (e.g., ID numbers, social security account numbers, passport numbers) or credit card numbers; 7.2.6 if we have reason to believe that you are utilizing the Generative Artificial Intelligence Service If you engage in illegal activities or may violate the provisions of this agreement, we can make independent judgments and have the right to take disposition measures without notifying you in advance. Disposition measures include but are not limited to warnings, restricting functions, suspending or terminating the provision of services to you, and investigating relevant legal responsibilities. 7.3 Information content specifications 7.3.1 information you input, output/generate, produce, comment, upload, publish, and disseminate should consciously abide by laws, administrative regulations, public order, respect social morality and ethics, socialist core values, national interests, respect for the legitimate rights and interests of others, moral customs, and information authenticity and other \\"seven bottom lines\\" requirements, otherwise we have the right to take corresponding measures immediately. You may not engage in the following acts by yourself or by allowing or assisting anyone to use this software and related services: (1) opposing the basic principles established by the Constitution; (2) endangering national security and interests, divulging state secrets; (3) subverting state power, overthrowing the socialist system, damaging the national image, inciting secession, undermining national unity and social stability; (4) harming national honor and interests; (5) advocating terrorism and extremism; (6) advocating ethnic hatred or undermining national unity; (7) advocating discrimination, hatred, and taking advantage of any vulnerability of a particular group based on their age, social, physical or mental characteristics to materially distort the behavior of a person belonging to that group, causing or likely causing physical or psychological harm to that person or another person. Including but not limited to civil discrimination, religious discrimination, nationality discrimination, gender discrimination, sexual orientation discrimination, age discrimination, occupation discrimination, health discrimination, geographical discrimination; (8) engaging in or assisting illegal or high-risk activities, such as: military and war, development of weapons, explosives or hazardous materials, management or operation of critical infrastructure (e.g. transportation, energy), creation or distribution of controlled substances or services, generation or dissemination of information related to self-harm, activities with high risk of economic harm, including gambling, automatic determination of credit eligibility, employment and education decisions; (9) undermining state religious policies, promoting cults and feudal superstitions; (10) fabricating, spreading rumors, misinformation, disrupting economic and social order, and undermining social stability; (11) Spreading, disseminating, or advocating violence, obscenity, pornography, explicit, gambling, homicide, terror, or abetting crime; (12) using, harming, or attempting to use or harm minors, harming the physical and mental health of minors, or infringing upon the legitimate rights and interests of minors; (13) insulting, defaming, offending, abusing, angering, bullying, or controlling others, or infringing upon the legitimate rights and interests of minors; (14) violently intimidating or threatening others, or conducting human flesh searches; (15) involving the privacy, personal information, or materials of others; (16) spreading obscene language, or harming social order and good morals; (17) violating commercial ethics, infringing upon the legitimate rights and interests of commercial secrets, infringing upon the privacy, reputation, honor, portrait, intellectual property, and trade control of others; (18) Dissemination of commercial advertisements, or similar commercial solicitation information, excessive marketing information, and spam information; (19) The published information is meaningless, or deliberately uses character combinations to evade technical review; (20) Contains terrorist, violent, bloody, highly dangerous content that endangers the physical and mental health of the performer or others; (21) Other information that violates laws, regulations, policies, and public order, interferes with the normal operation of this service, or infringes the legitimate rights and interests of other users or third parties. 7.3.2 you can complain to us through the aforementioned hotline, report all kinds of violations of laws and regulations, illegal communication activities, illegal and harmful information, etc., we will accept and deal with your complaints and reports in a timely manner, so as to jointly create a clean and upright cyberspace. 7.4 You also understand and agree that we have legal rights to the content provided in the AI role-related services. Intellectual property rights based on the output results automatically generated by your input content do not belong to you. 7.5 Special reminder, you shall not use new technologies and new applications based on deep learning to produce, publish, or disseminate misinformation. When you publish or disseminate information generated by new technologies and new applications based on deep learning, you shall be marked or prompted in a prominent manner. 7.6 We respect and protect the rights of personal information, privacy, etc. We remind you to avoid entering your personal information, sensitive personal information, private information, etc. during the conversation with the character robot. If your use of the service involves the processing of personal information, privacy, confidentiality or sensitive information, you should follow relevant laws and regulations, for example, you should obtain necessary consent when processing personal information.","Force_my_agreement_detail_2":"\\"Beijing Volcano Engine Technology Co., Ltd.\\" (\\"we\\") is the organizer of \\"2024 Winter Volcano Engine FORCE Power Conference\\" (referred to as \\"event/conference\\"). We attach great importance to the protection of user information. Please be sure to read this statement carefully before you fill in your personal information on the corresponding page of this Mini Program. Once you take the initiative to fill in your or other third-party personal information on the page and submit it, it means that you agree to our collection and use of the relevant information you submit in accordance with this statement. Article 1, Collection of personal information 1. The information you enter in the information filling page of the event/conference Mini Program is: phone number; when you use the AI interactive function, the character robot may collect the information (including text) and content instructions you actively enter. We will explain the collection and use rules of relevant personal information to you below. 2. You need to note that the above personal information is voluntarily selected by you. You have the right to refuse to provide it, but if the corresponding information is not provided, it will affect your participation in this event/conference or use of related functions. 3. You promise and guarantee that if you provide information about other personal information subjects, you have obtained the authorization and consent provided by the personal information subject for this information. The scope of the authorization and consent includes but is not limited to your submission of personal information to us, and agrees to our use as agreed in this statement. Article 2, Use and Provision of Personal Information 1. You agree that we can use personal information in the following ways: (1) We collect your mobile phone number for [recording your registration intention, so as to get in touch with you in time, send SMS notification of participation, and match information at the on-site check-in process of the conference. In addition, we will communicate with you about activities/meetings, products or services through human or voice robots, such as return visits, product recommendations, etc.]. (2) When you use the AI interactive function, the character robot collects the information you actively enter, which is used to analyze and calculate the above information, so as to understand your problem and context, so as to provide you with more relevant information. At the same time, under the premise of being processed by secure encryption technology, strictly de-identified and unable to re-identify specific individuals, the character robot may use the above collected data and the corresponding replies generated by the model for model training, and constantly adjust the effect of the optimized model. (3) If you intend to withdraw your authorization, delete or modify the personal information you submitted, you can contact us and we will cooperate as soon as possible. 2. If after you provide the above information, you click to enter the registration page to complete the registration, we will record your registration information; if after you provide the above information, you do not complete the registration, we will not return, store or provide the above information you provided to third parties. 3. We will strictly protect the security of your personal information. We will adopt appropriate systems, security technologies and procedures and other measures to protect your personal information from unauthorized access, use or leakage. We will also urge relevant service providers to protect your personal information. Article 3, Applicable law, this statement applies to the laws of the mainland of the People\'s Republic of China. Article 4, Changes, We will amend this statement from time to time, and such amendments form part of this statement. We will publish the revised statement. In this case, if you continue to participate in activities and provide information, you agree to be bound by the revised statement. Article 5, How to contact us. If you need to inquire, modify or correct your personal information, or have any questions or complaints about personal information protection issues, you can contact us by logging in to Volcano Engine \\"Official Website - Pre-sales/After-sales - Online Customer Service\\" or choosing to call the hotline 400-850-0030. Under normal circumstances, we will respond by the 15th day (the \\"response period\\"), but you understand and agree that due to the complexity of your request, the aforementioned response period may be delayed to 30 days, but we will inform you of the reason for the delay in an appropriate manner before the expiration of the response period.","Force_my_language":"Language settings","Force_my_language_Chinese":"Simplified Chinese","Force_my_language_English":"English","Force_my_log_in_now":"Log in now","Force_my_log_out":"Log out","Force_my_log_out_cancel":"Cancel","Force_my_log_out_confirm":"Confirm","Force_my_log_out_detail":"Confirm to log out of the current mobile phone number?","Force_my_questionnaire":"Questionnaire","Force_my_questionnaire_tip":"The survey will be open at {time}","Force_my_tip_1":"{name} guest","Force_my_tip_2":"Not registered yet","Force_my_tip_3":"Not logged in yet","Force_my_use_tip":"Welcome to the FORCE Original Power Mini Program","Force_name":"{{name}}","Force_part_not_open":"This module is only open to guests who have successfully registered for offline participation. It is detected that your currently logged in mobile phone number has not registered/passed the offline participation review. If you need to get the QR code, please change to the mobile phone number registered for offline participation to log in to the Mini Program.","Force_picture":"Photo","Force_schedule_1":"Keynote Speech: Heavy Release","Force_schedule_1_1":"Dreamina AI, dream now","Force_schedule_1_2":"Ask Doubao about everything, and ask Doubao the fastest","Force_schedule_1_3":"Global search, efficient memory, accelerate model landing","Force_schedule_2":"Technical Main Forum: AI + X Full Stack Capability Interpretation","Force