rst payment.","Incentive_plan_special_notice":"Note","Incentive_plan_special_notice_detail":"Keep creating easy-to-use and interesting agents to earn extra incentives based on the existing revenue share at specific ratios","Incentive_plan_today_earning":"Today\'s revenue (estimated)","Incentive_plan_today_earning_detail":"Today\'s estimated real-time revenue (subject to settlement)","Incentive_plan_understand":"Learn about incentive plan","Incentive_plan_wallet":"Wallet","Input":"Input","Intent.MultiAgentSessionType.Flow":"Send the next round of chat to the node where the user last replied","Intent.MultiAgentSessionType.Host":"Send the next round of chat to the starting node","Knowledge_exception_01":"Knowledge name limited to 100 characters","Knowledge_exception_02":"Unit name limited to 100 characters","Knowledge_exception_03":"Limited to 1,000 Knowledge","Knowledge_exception_04":"maximum of 300 units per knowledge","Knowledge_exception_05":"maximum of 10,000 segment per unit","Knowledge_exception_06":"Add up to 2GB per month","Knowledge_exception_07":"Store up to 10GB per account","Knowledge_exception_08":"Segment must be more than 0 character","Knowledge_exception_09":"Segment limited to 2,000 characters","Knowledge_exception_10":"Table format unit, the maximum is 10 columns","Knowledge_exception_11":"Table format unit with a 1,024-character limit per field","Knowledge_exception_12":"Table format unit, segment limited to 2,000 characters","Knowledge_exception_13":"Table format unit, with a 30 character limit for field names","Knowledge_exception_14":"Table format unit, maximum of 10,000 segment","LLM_understand_card":"LLM determine text output with card","Landing_agent_describe":"Explore more agents for you","Landing_agent_store":"Agent Store","Landing_banner_button":"Get Started","Landing_banner_describe":"Latest AI app development platform\\nBuild your agents without code and release them across multiple platforms with ready WebSDKs and APIs","Landing_banner_t