credits_cycle_app_tip4":"Agent","coze_premium_credits_cycle_app_tip5":"App","coze_premium_credits_cycle_app_tip6":"Sorry, the current message quota has been exhausted. To continue using, please purchase the Coze Premium plan.","coze_premium_credits_cycle_tip1":"Credits will reset to the specified number of sponsored messages at each set interval.","coze_premium_credits_cycle_tip2":"Excessive trial use increases credit costs, use wisely.","coze_premium_credits_cycle_tip3":"Free trials allow more users to discover the bot.","coze_premium_credits_cycle_tip4":"Increase sponsored messages to enable the credit refresh cycle.","coze_premium_credits_cycle_tip5":"Up to 100 free messages are offered, with credit costs varying depending on the models used by the bot, sponsored by the bot creator.","coze_premium_credits_cycle_tip6":"12:00 AM daily at UTC+0","coze_premium_credits_cycle_tip7":"12:00 AM every Monday at UTC+0","coze_premium_credits_cycle_tip8":"12:00 AM on the first day of every month at UTC+0","coze_premium_credits_reset":"Credits will reset in {counts}","coze_premium_fail":"Payment failed","coze_premium_lite":"Premium Lite","coze_premium_manage_payment":"Manage Payment Method","coze_premium_message_limit":"Sorry, the free chat quota for the current bot has been used up. If you wish to experience more bots, please visit: https://www.coze.com/","coze_premium_not_sup":"Payment not supported","coze_premium_not_sup_des":"Payment service currently unavailable in Russia and Taiwan","coze_premium_renew_confirm":"Continue coze premium subscription; payment will be auto-deducted after the current subscription expires","coze_premium_renew_confirm_title":"Renew subscription","coze_premium_sucess":"Payment successful","coze_pro":"Coze Pro","coze_pro_1":"Professional Edition","coze_pro_2":"Pricing by Bot Usage or RPM","coze_pro_3":"buy","coze_pro_4":"{price} Yuan","coze_pro_5":"month","coze_pro_active_1":"Benefits in effect","coze_pro_active_2":"Effective","coze_pro_active_3":