ted by the Bot. Note: Bot unmounted resources will not be copied to the professional version","coze_pro_migration_3":"Basic account to be migrated","coze_pro_migration_4":"Placeholder Copy - Please enter a unique username, not a user nickname","coze_pro_migration_5":"Migrate to Pro Space","coze_pro_migration_6":"Placeholder Copywriting - Please select Pro Edition Space","coze_pro_migration_7":"Generate authorization link","coze_pro_migration_8":"regenerate","coze_pro_migration_9":"migration authorization link","coze_pro_model_none":"No model available","coze_pro_model_null":"no model","coze_pro_payment_overdue":"Sorry, your account has an overdue payment, please recharge on volcengine before continuing to use it.","coze_pro_store_duplicate_workflow_error":"Sorry, due to model reasons, copying the workflow in the store is not supported for the time being.","coze_pro_title":"Package Details","coze_sidebar_adv_ver":"Advanced Version","coze_sidebar_api_mgmt":"API Management","coze_sidebar_coze_resource":"Credit","coze_sidebar_doc_center":"Document Center","coze_sidebar_ent_ver":"Enterprise Version","coze_sidebar_free_ver":"Free Version","coze_sidebar_org_mgmt":"Organization Management","coze_sidebar_space_cfg":"Space Configuration","coze_sidebar_task_center":"Task Center","coze_sidebar_team_ver":"Team Version","coze_sidebar_template_store":"Template Store","coze_sidebar_work_comm":"Work Community","coze_task_detail_all_status":"All Status","coze_task_detail_cancel":"Cancel","coze_task_detail_cancel2":"Cancel","coze_task_detail_cancel3":"Cancel","coze_task_detail_cancel4":"Cancel","coze_task_detail_cancel5":"Cancel","coze_task_detail_cancel6":"Cancel","coze_task_detail_cancel_irrecoverable":"Task Cannot Be Recovered After Cancellation","coze_task_detail_cancel_no_retry":"Task Cannot Be Retried After Cancellation","coze_task_detail_cancel_only_not_exec_num":"Only Cancel Not Executed Tasks Among Selected Ones; {num} Tasks Will Be Cancelled After Confirmation","coze_task_de