merce marketing, content creation, and video summarization, helping creators and enterprises efficiently produce high-quality video content with high conversion rates.","coze_template_store_tmpl_cat":"Template Category","coze_template_store_tmpl_topic":"Template Topic","coze_theme_dark":"Dark mode","coze_theme_light":"Light mode","coze_token_amount":"Choose amount","coze_token_buy1":"Buy Coze Tokens","coze_token_continue":"Continue","coze_token_cost_title":"Cost","coze_token_custom":"Customize","coze_token_failed":"Payment failed, please try again","coze_token_max_amount":"Maximum amount is 1,000","coze_token_model_section_title":"Model","coze_token_plugin_section_table_header_plugin":"Plugin","coze_token_plugin_section_table_usage_unit":"{number} function call","coze_token_plugin_section_title":"Plugin","coze_token_refund":"Coze token refund","coze_token_tokens":"Coze Tokens","coze_unit_number":"Unit/Month","coze_upgrade_to_pro_plan":"您好，账户的资源点余额不足，请等待额度刷新或充值资源点","coze_web_sdk_publish_des":"Deploy your agent as a Web SDK","coze_web_sdk_publish_install":"Insert the installation code into the <body> section of your webpage","coze_web_sdk_publish_install_copy":"Copy","coze_web_sdk_publish_install_des":"Installation","coze_web_sdk_publish_title":"Web SDK","cozedev_bothistory_commit_id":"Version ID：","cozedev_bothistory_debug_preview":"Debug","cozedev_bothistory_release_result":"Detail","cozedev_collaborator_btn_cancel":"Cancel","cozedev_collaborator_btn_confirm":"Confirm","cozedev_collaborator_btn_modify":"Modify","cozedev_collaborator_modify_confirm_title":"Confirm whether to modify the role of this collaborator?","cozedev_collaborator_modify_succeeded":"Modify succeeded.","cozedev_collaborator_no_permission_to_operate_info":"Your current role does not have the permission to operate Agent.","cozedev_collaborator_no_permission_to_submit_info":"Your current role does not have the permission to submit Agent draft.","cozedev_collaborator_operator_release_info_draft_change