elete image stream","imageflow_detail_end_answer_tooltip":"Edit the reply content of the Agent, that is, after the image stream is completed, the LLM in the Agent will no longer organize the language, but directly reply to the conversation with the original content edited here.\\nYou can use {variable name} to refer to variables in input parameters.","imageflow_detail_end_output_tooltip":"These variables will be output after the Agent calls the image stream. In \\"return variable\\" mode, these variables will be summarized by the Agent and replied to the user; in \\"direct answer\\" mode, the Agent will only reply to the \\"answer content\\" you set. But in any mode, these variables can be used when configuring the card.","imageflow_detail_error_obtain_status":"Failed to get the latest status of image stream","imageflow_detail_no_imageflow_description":"Click the button to create an image stream","imageflow_detail_no_search_result":"Image stream not found","imageflow_detail_node_workflow_search":"Search image stream","imageflow_detail_start_input_tooltip":"Define the input parameters required to start the image stream, which will be read by the LLM during the Agent conversation, so that the LLM can start the image stream at the right time and fill in the correct information","imageflow_detail_toast_createcopy_succeed":"Image stream copy created","imageflow_edit":"Edit image stream","imageflow_explore":"Explore Image Stream","imageflow_generate_no_use":"This mode is currently unavailable","imageflow_generation_desc1":"The default is 25, the range is [1, 40], the larger the value, the finer the picture, and the longer the generation time.","imageflow_generation_desc2":"Add a reference image for image generation, only if the image reference node is referenced","imageflow_generation_desc3":"Enter the information to be added to the prompt, which can be referenced by the prompt below","imageflow_generation_desc4":"Edit prompts for image models to generate content","imagef