Framework","new_landing_eino_footer_button_get_start":"Get Started","new_landing_eino_getstart":"GitHub","new_landing_eino_selling_point1_description":"Eino abstracts common capabilities in AI app development into components","new_landing_eino_selling_point1_description2":"Unified definitions make AI app capabilities simple and clear. Each component abstraction has multiple out-of-the-box implementations","new_landing_eino_selling_point1_linkname":"Learn More","new_landing_eino_selling_point1_title":"Unified component abstractions and rich implementations","new_landing_eino_selling_point2_description":"Offers multiple powerful and flexible arrangement modes: Graph, Chain, Workflow","new_landing_eino_selling_point2_description2":"Explain complex business logic simply. Arrangement also provides type checking, concurrency management, aspect management, and extensible option capabilities","new_landing_eino_selling_point2_title":"Flexible arrangement capabilities","new_landing_eino_selling_point3_description":"Four request interaction modes based on whether input and output are streams: invoke, stream, collect, and transform","new_landing_eino_selling_point3_description2":"Eino provides capabilities such as automatic stream conversion, merging, and copying","new_landing_eino_selling_point3_title":"Comprehensive stream processing capabilities","new_landing_eino_selling_point4_description":"Visualized arrangement and debugging tools. Build an AI app with just a few drags and drops. AI app development made simple","new_landing_eino_selling_point4_title":"Powerful toolchain","new_landing_eino_slogan":"Eino Framework","new_landing_eino_slogan2":"Agent development has never been easier","new_landing_eino_slogan_button_get_start":"Get Started","new_landing_eino_tips_describe":"Golang AI app development framework","new_landing_eino_tips_title":"Eino","new_landing_footer_button_get_start":"Try for Free","new_landing_getstart":"Login Coze","new_landing_loop":"Debugging Tools","new