","performance_min_match_deg_exception":"Please choose between 0.01-0.99","performance_model":"Model","performance_model_latency_tips":"As the average response time of the model, it reflects the overall performance of the model.","performance_off":"Off","performance_one_min":"1 minute","performance_percentile":"Percentile","performance_plugin":"Plugins","performance_publish_channel":"Publish Channel","performance_qps":"Query Per Second","performance_qps_bot":"As the average number of queries received per second, it reflects the query load of the agent.","performance_qps_code":"As the average number of code corresponding function fragment calls per second, it reflects the execution load.","performance_qps_knowledge_recall":"As the average number of knowledge recalls per second, it reflects the recall load of the knowledge.","performance_qps_llm":"As the average number of large model calls per second, it reflects the call load of the large model.","performance_qps_plugin":"As the average number of plugin calls per second, it reflects the load of the plugin.","performance_qps_workflow":"As the average number of workflow calls per second, it reflects the load of the workflow.","performance_query_to_first_token":"Query Time-To-First-Tokens","performance_query_to_first_token_tips":"As the average time delay from when the agent receives the query to when the first token is returned, it reflects the agent response speed that the querying party can perceive.","performance_recall_latency":"Recall Latency","performance_recall_latency_tips":"As the average recall time of the knowledge, it reflects the recall performance of the knowledge.","performance_recall_qps":"Recalls / sec","performance_recall_qps_knowledge":"As the average number of knowledge recalls per second, it reflects the recall load of the knowledge.","performance_recall_success_rate":"Recall Success Rate","performance_recall_success_rate_tips":"As the average recall success rate of the knowledge, it reflects the s