ed","project_ide_toast_duplicate_view":"View","project_ide_toast_edit_success":"Updated successfully","project_ide_tooltips_no_editing_permissions":"No edit permission","project_ide_unsaved_changes":"Unsaved changes","project_ide_unsaved_describe":"Some changes are not saved. Are you sure you want to exit?","project_ide_view_document":"View document","project_ide_welcome_close_all_tab":"Close all tabs","project_ide_welcome_db_describ":"Preset knowledge (RAG) and database to integrate private data in your AI applications","project_ide_welcome_db_title":"Configure database and knowledge","project_ide_welcome_describe":"Start with Coze and develop your AI application now.","project_ide_welcome_title":"Hi, Welcome to Coze App IDE","project_ide_welcome_ui_builder_describe":"Drag-and-drop components for easy interactive UI building","project_ide_welcome_ui_builder_title":"UI Builder (Coming Soon)","project_ide_welcome_workflow_describe":"Offer nodes like LLMs, APIs, and flow control for flexible development via workflows","project_ide_welcome_workflow_title":"Build backend with workflows","project_ide_workflow_change_banner":"If you modify and publish this workflow, the app and other workflows that reference this workflow may be affected.","project_library_add_voice":"Voice","project_library_type_voice":"Voice","project_library_voice_add_cancel":"Cancel","project_library_voice_add_confirm":"Confirm","project_library_voice_add_describe":"Voice description","project_library_voice_add_describe_placeholder":"Describe the characteristics of the voice","project_library_voice_add_fail_button":"Got It","project_library_voice_add_fail_content":"The number of voices (1/1) created by the current account has reached the limit.","project_library_voice_add_fail_title":"No more voices can be created","project_library_voice_add_finished_chances":"{leftChangce}/{allChance} chances remaining","project_library_voice_add_finished_hover_delete":"Delete","project_library_voice_add_finished_hover_re_record":"Re-record","project_library_voice_add_finished_hover_re_upload":"Re-upload","project_library_voice_add_finished_replicate":"Start replication","project_library_voice_add_finished_title_record":"Recording completed. Click button","project_library_voice_add_finished_title_start":"Start replication.","project_library_voice_add_finished_title_upload":"Uploaded successfully. Click button","project_library_voice_add_icon":"Icon","project_library_voice_add_language":"Language","project_library_voice_add_listen_confirm":"Confirm","project_library_voice_add_listen_content":"Voice preview","project_library_voice_add_listen_content_cn":"扣子是新一代 AI 应用开发平台。无论你是否有编程基础，都可以快速搭建出各种应用和智能体，并一键发布到各大社交平台，或者轻松部署到自己的网站","project_library_voice_add_listen_content_en":"Coze is a new generation AI application development platform. Whether you have a programming background or not, you can quickly build various applications and agents, and publish them to major social platforms with one click, or easily deploy them to your own website.","project_library_voice_add_listen_content_es":"Coze es una plataforma de desarrollo de aplicaciones de IA de nueva generaci\xf3n. Ya tengas conocimientos de programaci\xf3n o no, puedes crear r\xe1pidamente diversas aplicaciones y agentes, y publicarlos en las principales plataformas sociales con un solo clic, o desplegarlos f\xe1cilmente en tu propio sitio web.","project_library_voice_add_listen_content_id":"Coze adalah platform pengembangan aplikasi AI generasi baru. Apakah Anda memiliki latar belakang pemrograman atau tidak, Anda dapat dengan cepat membangun berbagai aplikasi dan agen, dan mempublikasikannya ke platform sosial utama dengan satu klik, atau dengan mudah menerapkannya ke situs web Anda sendiri.","project_library_voice_add_listen_content_ja":"Coze は新世代の AI アプリケーション開発プラットフォームです。プログラミングの知識があるかどうかに関係なく、さまざまなアプリケーションやエージェントを迅速に構築し、ワンクリックで主要なソーシャルプラットフォームに公開するか、簡単に自分のウェブサイトに展開することができます。","project_library_voice_add_listen_content_pt":"Coze \xe9 uma plataforma de desenvolvimento de aplicativos de IA de nova gera\xe7\xe3o. Quer voc\xea tenha ou n\xe3o conhecimento de programa\xe7\xe3o, pode criar rapidamente v\xe1rios aplicativos e agentes, e public\xe1-los nas principais plataformas sociais com um clique, ou implant\xe1-los facilmente em seu pr\xf3prio site.","project_library_voice_add_listen_content_zh":"扣子是新一代 AI 应用开发平台。无论你是否有编程基础，都可以快速搭建出各种应用和智能体，并一键发布到各大社交平台，或者轻松部署到自己的网站","project_library_voice_add_listen_generate_text":"Generate","project_library_voice_add_listen_generate_title":"Enter text to generate voice","project_library_voice_add_listen_re_replicatex":"Re-replicate","project_library_voice_add_listen_title":"Replicated successfully. Listen to the audio.","project_library_voice_add_name":"Voice name","project_library_voice_add_name_placeholder":"Enter voice name","project_library_voice_add_record_content":"Coze stitches time into life. With this app, a story unfolds, threading warmth and poetry through everyday moments.","project_library_voice_add_record_content_cn":"扣子，如时光的针脚，缝缀着岁月的衣衫。一颗扣子，一段故事，锁住那些珍贵的记忆，在细微处低语，串联起生活的温暖与诗意。","project_library_voice_add_record_content_en":"Coze, like the gentle whispers of the breeze, caresses the moments of our lives\' ease. A coze, a chapter of tales untold, weaving the fabric of friendship\'s gold.","project_library_voice_add_record_content_es":"Coze, como hilos del tiempo, teje nuestros d\xedas. Un amigo fiel, guarda historias y susurra memorias. En cada detalle, conecta la calidez y la poes\xeda de la vida. Coze est\xe1 siempre contigo, en cada paso y en cada risa.","project_library_voice_add_record_content_id":"Coze, seperti jahitan waktu, menyulam hari-hari kita. Teman setia, mengunci cerita dan kenangan berharga. Dalam setiap detail, menghubungkan kehangatan dan keindahan hidup.","project_library_voice_add_record_content_ja":"Coze、そよ風のように、日々の安らぎを包み込む。Coze、友達のように寄り添い、友情の物語を紡ぐ。","project_library_voice_add_record_content_pt":"Coze, como pontos do tempo, costura nossos dias. Um amigo leal, guarda hist\xf3rias e sussurra mem\xf3rias. Em cada detalhe, conecta o calor e a poesia da vida.","project_library_voice_add_record_content_zh":"扣子，如时光的针脚，缝缀着岁月的衣衫。一颗扣子，一段故事，锁住那些珍贵的记忆，在细微处低语，串联起生活的温暖与诗意。","project_library_voice_add_record_end":"End recording","project_library_voice_add_record_time":"Recording… ({time}s)","project_library_voice_add_record_title":"Please read the following text aloud","project_library_voice_add_start_content":"(Recommended) Upload or record an audio clip of 10s to 30s in WAV, MP3, or M4A format, with a maximum file size of 8 MB. Ensure the audio is free from multiple speakers, significant background noise, interference, or reverberation.","project_library_voice_add_start_record":"Start recording","project_library_voice_add_start_title":"Record or upload audio for replication","project_library_voice_add_start_upload":"Upload audio","project_library_voice_add_title":"Create voice","project_library_voice_add_toast_create_fail":"Creation failed","project_library_voice_add_toast_microphone_fail":"Failed to start recording. Please check whether the microphone is enabled.","project_library_voice_add_toast_ordinary":"Upgrade to Coze Pro so you can try tone cloning and more voice features","project_library_voice_add_toast_professional":"Voice cloning is still under beta testing. Please fill out an application:","project_library_voice_add_toast_professional_link":"Application link","project_library_voice_add_toast_update_fail":"Update failed","project_library_voice_delete_cancel":"Cancel","project_library_voice_delete_confirm":"Delete","project_library_voice_delete_content":"Once the voice is deleted, it cannot be recovered","project_library_voice_delete_title":"Are you sure you want to delete the voice?","project_library_voice_detail_chances":"Remaining replication chances","project_library_voice_detail_creator":"Owner","project_library_voice_detail_language":"Language","project_library_voice_detail_latest_t