e configured message output nodes in the app.","project_release_chatflow_desc2":"When you send a message on a third-party platform, Coze will call this chatflow to reply to you based on all the configured message output nodes in the app.","project_release_choose_oauth":"Please select an OAuth app","project_release_code_desc":"Packaging the code… You will view a download link and receive a message after the package is completed.","project_release_coze":"Publish to Coze","project_release_coze1":"Coze","project_release_coze_audit":"Coze review","project_release_create_oauth":"Create OAuth App","project_release_create_oauth_app":"Crate OAuth App","project_release_display_label":"Display as","project_release_doubao_desc":"Publish to Doubao to chat with the bot anytime, anywhere.","project_release_doubao_open":"Open in Doubao","project_release_douyin_desc":"Interact in private chats and follower group chats with your Douyin account.","project_release_douyin_h5_desc":"Preview","project_release_download_code":"Code-based","project_release_example":"Sample version: V0.0.1","project_release_example1":"Current version: {version}","project_release_example2":"Please enter a version number","project_release_example3":"The version number already exists","project_release_failed":"Failed","project_release_feishu_desc":"Chat with Feishu bot to improve work productivity.","project_release_finish":"Completed","project_release_guide":"Installation Guide","project_release_h5_desc":"You can publish your project to WeChat or Douyin mini programs, or by downloading a code package.","project_release_h5_release1":"Fully managed","project_release_h5desc2":"Managed hosting with one-click publishing to Mini Programs is supported","project_release_illegal1":"You can publish an app as a template when it contains your own resources","project_release_illegal10":"The plugin in the app contains prohibited information","project_release_illegal11":"The knowledge, databases, or variables in the app conta