uency","query_analytics_frequency_statics":"Frequency Statistics","query_analytics_frequency_statics_tips":"As statistics of user intentions and the frequency of agent skills being triggered after the agent is deployed, they reflect the objective status of the agent during online operations.","query_analytics_intent":"Intent","query_analytics_intent_contri_rank":"Intention Contribution Ranking","query_analytics_intent_contri_rank_tops":"Based on satisfaction scores and frequency of occurrence for each type of user intention, the contribution of each intention to the overall satisfaction score is calculated, reflecting the impact of different intentions on the overall satisfaction score.","query_analytics_intent_rank":"Intent Ranking","query_analytics_intent_tips":"Count users\' intention and frequency according to the communication content between users and the agent.","query_analytics_jump_to_traces":"Click to see queries","query_analytics_level_one":"First level classification","query_analytics_level_tips":"Represents the abstraction level of intent classification statistics. The higher the level, the higher the abstraction level and the coarser the classification granularity.","query_analytics_level_two":"Second level classification","query_analytics_other_intent":"Click to see other intents","query_analytics_other_skill":"Click to see other skills","query_analytics_others":"Others","query_analytics_pie_chart":"Pie chart","query_analytics_plugin":"Plugin","query_analytics_refresh_page_tips":"Please refresh after publishing the agent.","query_analytics_skill_rank":"Triggered Skills Ranking","query_analytics_skill_tips":"Count the Agent skills and corresponding frequencies that are triggered when the user communicates with the Agent, and rank them according to the frequency of triggering. Skills refer to the plugins and workflows when building an agent.","query_analytics_triggerred_skill_rank":"Triggered Skill Ranking","query_analytics_unpublished_bot_tips":"The ag