": {\\n        \\"agent_all\\": {\\n          \\"chat\\": \\"{\\\\\\"model_id\\\\\\":1708935709}\\"\\n        },\\n        \\"agent_7350933295489892370\\": {\\n          \\"chat\\": \\"{\\\\\\"search_module_config\\\\\\":{\\\\\\"search_module_dsl\\\\\\":\\\\\\"{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"nodes\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"query_split\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"LLMQuerySplit\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"global_search\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"GlobalSearch\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"config\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"top_k\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":5,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"need_full_text\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":true}},{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"prompt_builder\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"SearchPromptBuilder\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"graph\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"query_split -> global_search -> prompt_builder\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}\\\\\\"}}\\"\\n        },\\n        \\"agent_7369482712421335058\\": {\\n          \\"chat\\": \\"{\\\\\\"retrievers\\\\\\":{\\\\\\"service\\\\\\":{\\\\\\"recall_links\\\\\\":{\\\\\\"max_token\\\\\\":128000}}}}\\"\\n        }\\n      },\\n      \\"bot_engine\\": {\\n        \\"bot_mapping_config\\": {\\n          \\"target_bot_id\\": \\"7350874563795845138\\"\\n        }\\n      }\\n    },\\n    \\"ext\\": {\\n      \\"answer_with_suggest\\": \\"1\\",\\n      \\"media_search_type\\": \\"1\\",\\n      \\"wiki\\": \\"1\\"\\n    },\\n    \\"update_version_code\\": \\"6050040\\"\\n  }\\n}","runtime_parameter_tips_coze_bot":"When there is no need to specify special runtime parameters, you do not need to pay attention;\\n\\nAn example of supported runtime parameters is as follows:\\n{\\n  \\"env\\": \\"test\\", // Lane environment\\n  \\"model_type\\": \\"3\\", // model_id, specify this parameter when a specific model is needed（Effectively to all agents in the multi-agent mode agent）\\n  \\"user_id\\": \\"1234567\\" // userID on the coze platform\\n  \\"user_nickname\\": \\"\\", // user nickname. Doubao/cici personalized demand usage\\n  \\"connector_uid\\": \\"\\", // channel user ID\\n  \\"tools_auth_info\\": {}, // plugin authorization information\\n  \\"ext\\": {} // extended field\\n}","runtime_parameter_tips_custom":"When there is no need to specify special runtime parameters, you do not need to pay attention;\\n\\nAn example of supported runtime parameters is as follows:\\n{\\n  \\"env\\": \\"test\\"// Lane environment\\n}","runtime_parameter_tips_fornax_agent":"When there is no need to specify special runtime parameters, you do not need to pay attention;\\n\\nAn example of supported runtime parameters is as follows:\\n{\\n  \\"env\\": \\"test\\" // Lane environment\\n}","runtime_parameter_tips_fornax_app":"When there is no need to specify special runtime parameters, you do not need to pay attention;\\n\\nAn example of supported runtime parameters is as follows:\\n{\\n\\"env\\": \\"test\\", // Lane environment\\n\\"cluster\\": \\"default\\" //service cluster\\n}","scene_background_tooltip":"When the scenario is running, this information is included in the prompt for the host and all other members.","scene_beta_sign":"Beta","scene_beta_sign_title":"Beta: Be careful to back up data locally","scene_beta_sign_tooltip":"This feature is in beta testing, and we may make significant updates and changes. There is a risk that the data you are currently editing could be lost. We suggest you save important information and stay updated with subsequent releases.","scene_bot_invalid":"The agent associated is invalid","scene_chat_error_empty_seat_fix_content":"{nickname} is a placeholder role with fixed speech in the workflow. Please modify it.","scene_chat_error_general":"An error has occurred and the dialog is suspended","scene_chat_error_retry_button":"Retry","scene_chat_error_retry_title":"The scenario is suspended unexpectedly. Clic