ited","variable_preset_variable_sys_coordinates_desc":"The latitude and longitude of the user\'s real-time location, in the order of latitude first, longitude second, using this variable will trigger user authorization.","variable_preset_variable_sys_lat_lon":"sys_lat_lon","variable_preset_variable_sys_lat_lon_desc":"The latitude and longitude of the user\'s real-time location, in the order of latitude first, longitude second, using this variable will trigger user authorization.","variable_preset_variable_sys_latitude_desc":"The latitude of the user\'s real-time location, using this variable will trigger user authorization.","variable_preset_variable_sys_lon_lat":"sys_lon_lat","variable_preset_variable_sys_lon_lat_desc":"The longitude and latitude of the user\'s real-time location, in the order of longitude first, latitude second, using this variable will trigger user authorization.","variable_preset_variable_sys_longitude_desc":"The longitude of the user\'s real-time location, using this variable will trigger user authorization.","variable_read_source_invalid":"Invalid value source","variable_read_type_mismatch":"Selected variable type does not match","variable_reset":"Reset data","variable_reset_confirm":"Reset data?","variable_reset_fail_tips":"Reset failed","variable_reset_no":"Cancel","variable_reset_succ_tips":"Reset successfully","variable_reset_tips":"All data will be reset to default value.","variable_reset_yes":"Confirm","variable_select_empty_appide_tips":"No variables found. Please go to Global Settings > Variables to configure a variable.","variable_select_empty_library_tips":"No variables found. Please link an agent or app with variables in the test run first.","variable_select_empty_library_tips_02":"No variable is available","variable_system_describtion":"Displays the data that you enabled as needed, which can be used to identify users via IDs or handle channel-specific features. The data is automatically generated and is read-only.","variable_system