igure","video_generation_node_image_url_explain":"It can support configuring end-to-end frames and multi-picture references for video generation","video_generation_node_max_images":"max_image","video_generation_node_max_images_explain":"Control the maximum number of pictures that can be generated. If the number of configurations is greater than 1, you can specify to generate multiple pictures in the prompt; the number of reference pictures entered is limited to + the number of finally generated pictures is ≤ 15","video_generation_node_pay":"Payment node","video_generation_node_pay_tips_1":"Generating a 1080p 5s video is expected to cost 25w tokens, the corresponding Lite model consumes about 2400 resource points, and the pro model consumes about 3600 resource points. Different durations, resolutions, and models consume different points.","video_generation_node_pay_tips_2":"Free 100wtoken","video_generation_node_pay_tips_3":"For more details, see:","video_generation_node_pay_tips_4":"Video generation node documentation","video_generation_node_ratio":"ratio","video_generation_node_reference_image_explain":"You can specify the combination of multiple pictures in natural language. For better instruction follow effect, it is recommended to use \\"[Figure 1] xxx, [Figure 2] xxx\\" to specify pictures; Note: Reference pictures and end-to-end frames cannot be configured at the same time, only one configuration is supported","video_generation_node_reference_image_tips":"Configuring reference and end-to-end frames at the same time is not supported","video_generation_node_resolution":"resolution","video_generation_node_watermark":"watermark","video_model_require_image_understanding":"The model requires image understanding support","video_pre_speech_frame_extraction_desc":"The number of seconds of frames extracted before the user starts speaking. Mainly compatible with continuous action scenarios. Used to help the model understand what the user was doing before starting to spea