ase enter integer","workflow_detail_node_batch_max":"Maximum times","workflow_detail_node_batch_off":"Off","workflow_detail_node_batch_on":"On","workflow_detail_node_batch_tooltip":"In batch processing mode, the node will run multiple times. In each run, the batch list will assign an item to the batch variable in order, until it reaches the batch limit or the maximum length of the list","workflow_detail_node_delete":"Delete","workflow_detail_node_error_empty":"Variable value can not be empty","workflow_detail_node_error_format":"It can only contain letters, digits, and underscores, and must start with a letter or underscore","workflow_detail_node_error_format_numstart":"Cannot start with a number","workflow_detail_node_error_name_duplicated":"The current variable name {name} is duplicated","workflow_detail_node_error_name_empty":"Variable name cannot be empty","workflow_detail_node_error_variablename":"Can only contain letters or numbers or underscores, and start with letter or underscore","workflow_detail_node_error_variablename_duplicated":"Parameters cannot be duplicated","workflow_detail_node_input":"Enter","workflow_detail_node_input_duplicated":"Variable names can not be duplicated","workflow_detail_node_input_entername":"Enter a parameter name","workflow_detail_node_input_entervalue":"Select value","workflow_detail_node_input_selectvalue":"Enter the parameter value","workflow_detail_node_name_default":"Enter node name","workflow_detail_node_name_error_empty":"Node name cannot be empty","workflow_detail_node_nodata":"No data found","workflow_detail_node_output":"Output","workflow_detail_node_output_action":"Action","workflow_detail_node_output_add_subitem":"Add sub-item","workflow_detail_node_output_parsingfailed":"Parsing failed, please delete this node and add it again","workflow_detail_node_parameter_input":"Input","workflow_detail_node_parameter_name":"Variable name","workflow_detail_node_parameter_reference":"Reference","workflow_detail_node_parameter_value":"Variable value","workflow_detail_node_raw_output":"Raw Output","workflow_detail_node_rename":"Rename","workflow_detail_node_resource_lose":"The resource referenced by this node cannot be found","workflow_detail_node_save_error":"Save Error","workflow_detail_node_search":"Search plugins","workflow_detail_node_tools":"Plugins","workflow_detail_node_workflow_delete":"This workflow has already been deleted","workflow_detail_node_workflow_search":"Search workflows","workflow_detail_node_workflows_max":"最多显示 {number} 条最近修改的工作流","workflow_detail_node_workflows_not_referencing":"This workflow contains other workflows and cannot be referenced","workflow_detail_node_workflows_referencing":"{number} Workflows Referencing","workflow_detail_node_workflows_referencing_impact":"Publish impact","workflow_detail_node_workflows_referencing_invalid":"Related Workflows may be invalid","workflow_detail_node_workflows_referencing_relationship":"Reference relationship","workflow_detail_node_workflows_referencing_tip":"A total of {number} workflows have referenced this workflow, and you have permission to view {number} workflows. This list only displays the workflows that you have permission to view.","workflow_detail_node_workflows_referencing_update":"This workflow contains the following reference relationships. Publishing the update will have the following impacts. Are you sure to publish the update?","workflow_detail_publish_nested_reference_error":"This workflow is being referenced by other workflows, so you cannot add any workflow nodes to this workflow.","workflow_detail_redo_tooltip":"Redo","workflow_detail_select_delete_popup_subtitle":"Once deleted, it cannot be recovered.","workflow_detail_select_delete_popup_title":"Delete the selected nodes?","workflow_detail_start_input_description":"Enter variable description","workflow_detail_start_input_tooltip":"It defines the input parameters required to start the workflow. The content is read by the LLM during your chat with the ag