ference an array (where its length indicates the number of loops), specify a value, or select \\"Enable infinite loop\\". Note that if you select \\"Enable infinite loop\\", you must complete the loops based on the \\"End loop\\" node.","workflow_maximum_parallel_runs":"Parallel runs","workflow_maximum_parallel_runs_tips":"The number of parallel runs. If you set it to 1, nodes are executed one by one.","workflow_maximum_run_count":"Upper limit of batch processing","workflow_maximum_run_count_tips":"The total number of batch runs cannot exceed the upper limit","workflow_memory_search_node":"Long-term Memory Retrieval","workflow_memory_search_node_input_tips":"Please configure the information to be retrieved from the memory bank and the maximum number of results allowed.","workflow_memory_search_node_limit_tips":"Please configure the maximum number of memories to be retrieved. If left blank, the default maximum is 20 entries.","workflow_memory_search_node_query_tips":"Enter the key information to be matched from the long-term memory.","workflow_memory_search_node_tips":"Used to call up messages from the designated memory bank and retrieve the user\'s personalized information.","workflow_memory_write_node":"Long-term Memory Writing","workflow_memory_write_node_input_tips":"Enter the messages to be added to the memory bank (typically multi-turn conversations). Note that the message format must be in array-object format; for specific formatting rules, please refer to the introduction document.","workflow_memory_write_node_libaray":"Memory","workflow_memory_write_node_libaray_tips":"Please select the memory bank you want to designate. Only one memory bank can be selected.","workflow_memory_write_node_select":"Please Select a Memory Bank","workflow_memory_write_node_tips":"Add a batch of messages (typically multi-turn conversations) to the designated memory bank. The system will automatically process and store the messages, forming structured memory events.","workflow_message_anwser_tooltips":"Edit the agent\'s reply content, that is, during the workflow running process, the agent will directly reply to the conversation with the original content edited here. You can use the {{variable name}} to reference variables in the output parameters.","workflow_message_streaming_name":"Streaming output","workflow_message_streaming_tooltips":"When enabled, the generated content from the large language model in the reply will be streamed and output word by word. When disabled, the reply content will be generated and output all at once.","workflow_message_variable_tooltips":"When the agent calls the workflow, it\'ll output these variables. It\'ll respond with just the \\"answer content\\" you\'ve set. You can use these variables while configuring the card.","workflow_mouse_friendly":"Mouse-friendly","workflow_mouse_friendly_desc":"Left-click to drag the canvas and zoom with the scroll wheel","workflow_multi_choice_copy_failed":"The Start/End node cannot be duplicated","workflow_multi_choice_copy_partial_success":"The Start/End node cannot be duplicated, other nodes have been copied to the clipboard","workflow_multi_choice_copy_success":"Nodes have been copied to the clipboard","workflow_multi_choice_delete_failed":"The Start/End node cannot be deleted","workflow_nl_autofix":"AI auto - correction","workflow_no_change_tooltip":"The workflow has not been modified, and no additional release is required","workflow_node_copy_othercanva":"The current canvas type is inconsistent and cannot be pasted.","workflow_node_from_store":"Reference from store","workflow_node_has_delete":"The node has been deleted","workflow_node_invalid":"The node is invalid","workflow_node_list_no_matching_content":"Please re-search","workflow_node_list_no_matching_title":"No nodes found","workflow_node_lose_efficacy":"The plugin {name} is invalid","workflow_node_lose_efficacy_if":"The imageflow {name} is invalid","workflow_node_lose_efficacy_wf":"The workflow {name} is invalid","