务均已完成，你已自愿放弃服务","delete_account_confirm_desc_title5":"本账号被注销后，你将无法登录、使用本帐号，以及包括但不限于：","delete_account_confirm_title":"为保证你的账号安全，在你提交的注销申请生效前，需同时满足以下条件：","delete_account_delete_aweme_logined_label":"你已登录关联的{platform}账号","delete_account_delete_aweme_not_login_label":"若要继续，你需要登录关联的{platform}账号","delete_account_delete_back":"上一步","delete_account_delete_confirm":"立即删除","delete_account_delete_directly_desc":"你可以直接删除你的账号","delete_account_delete_not_support_desc":"出错了，账号暂时无法册除，请稍后再试","delete_account_delete_phone_desc":"若要继续，需要完成短信验证。请输入我们通 过短信发送的验证码。","delete_account_delete_phone_validate_fail":"验证码错误","delete_account_delete_title":"删除账号","delete_account_directly":"你可以直接删除你的账号。","delete_account_enter_button":"删除账号","delete_account_feedback_error":"删除账号失败","delete_account_feedback_success":"账号已删除","delete_account_modal_account_label":"账号","delete_account_modal_cancel_button":"取消","delete_account_modal_confirm":"Delete","delete_account_modal_confirm_button":"删除","delete_account_modal_content":"删除账号后，你将无法找回账号信息，你的所有数据也会一并删除。同时，你在豆包、星绘、猫箱、扣子和豆包爱学上（若有）使用相同登录方式的账号数据也会被删除，包括账号基本信息、会话信息等。此外，你的猫箱会员高级功能（若有）也会失效，请取消你在猫箱的连续会员订阅（若有）后，再在这里申请删除账号。","delete_account_modal_danger_info":"删除账号后，将删除账号下的所有数据，包括创建的 智能体、插件、工作流、知识库等。为保障工作空间的数据安全，删除账号前，你还需要退出所有工作空间。还请注意，使用相同方式登录的 Cici/Anydoor/Butterfly 账号数据也会被同时删除。","delete_account_modal_error":"删除账号失败","delete_account_modal_input_confirm_label":"delete account","delete_account_modal_input_placeholder":"Type “delete your account”","delete_account_modal_input_tip":"To confirm，type “delete your account” below","delete_account_modal_input_tip_after":" below","delete_account_modal_input_tip_prefix":"To confirm，type ","delete_account_modal_input_tip_strong":"\\"delete account\\"","delete_account_modal_success":"Account deleted successfully","delete_account_modal_title":"确认删除账号？","delete_account_not_support_desc":"该账号目前不支持删除操作。","delete_account_not_support_third_desc":"The account does not support your third party account.","delete_account_phone_desc":"请输