age_config_edit_pop_placeholder2":"选择bizType之后自动获取选项","enterprise_manage_content_safety_page_config_edit_pop_policy":"我已阅读并知悉{doc}","enterprise_manage_content_safety_page_config_edit_pop_policy_agree":"同意并继续","enterprise_manage_content_safety_page_config_edit_pop_policy_detail":"企业自定义安全策略须知","enterprise_manage_content_safety_page_config_edit_pop_policy_detail1":"切换后，智能体、工作流、应用等场景将使用你在火山配置的内容安全审查策略","enterprise_manage_content_safety_page_config_edit_pop_policy_detail2":"切换到自定义安全策略后，你须遵守《中华人民共和国网络安全法》、《计算机信息网络国际联网安全保护管理办法》（公安部令第33号）、《互联网信息服务管理办法》（国务院292号令）、《网络信息内容生态治理规定》及其他适用法律法规的规定","enterprise_manage_content_safety_page_config_edit_pop_policy_detail3":"切换后，您的智能体只能发布到api渠道，其他渠道如扣子商店、模板、自定义渠道将无法发布","enterprise_manage_content_safety_page_config_edit_pop_policy_detail4":"切换后，部分问题可能仍然无法回答，这可能是你使用模型底层存在内容安全策略，若是方舟模型，可联系方舟进行豁免","enterprise_manage_content_safety_page_config_edit_pop_save":"保存并应用","enterprise_manage_content_safety_page_config_edit_pop_sencename":"火山场景名称","enterprise_manage_content_safety_page_config_edit_pop_strategy":"内容安全策略","enterprise_manage_content_safety_page_config_edit_pop_tips1":"请选择火山应用ID","enterprise_manage_content_safety_page_config_edit_pop_tips2":"请选择场景bizType","enterprise_manage_content_safety_page_config_log":"审核日志","enterprise_manage_content_safety_page_desc":"可将扣子对话场景内容安全策略切换至火山引擎提供的自定义内容安全服务，注意：自定义内容安全策略仅在发布至API渠道的智能体\\\\应用生效，其他渠道仍使用扣子平台策略。","enterprise_manage_content_safety_page_tag_sence":"场景","enterprise_manage_content_safety_page_tag_sence_query_input":"对话-用户输入","enterprise_manage_content_safety_page_tag_sence_response":"对话-模型输出","enterprise_manage_content_safety_page_tag_strategy":"内容安全策略","enterprise_manage_content_safety_page_tag_strategy_coze":"扣子安全策略","enterprise_manage_content_safety_page_tag_strategy_vocl":"火山安全策略","enterprise_manage_content_safety_page_tag_type":"内容类型","enterprise_manage_content_safety_page_tag_type_img":"图片","enterprise_manage_content_safety_page_tag_type_text":"文本","enterprise_manage_content_safety_page_title