作","eval_error_duplicate_column":"错误：发现重复的列名 \\"{column_name}\\"","eval_error_message":"{evaluation_name} 评测集错误，请清除后继续","eval_error_missing_column":"错误：缺少必填列 \\"{column_name}\\"","eval_error_missing_field":"错误：第 {row_number} 行缺少必填字段 \\"{field_name}\\"","eval_error_query_limit":"错误：会话 {session_id} 的对话轮次超过限制。每个会话最多允许 {max_queries} 轮对话","eval_error_session_limit":"错误：会话数超过限制。最多允许 {max_sessions} 个，当前有 {current_sessions} 个","eval_evaluation":"评测","eval_evaluation_count":"评测次数","eval_evaluation_details":"评估明细","eval_evaluation_history":"评测历史","eval_evaluation_rating":"评估打分","eval_evaluation_set":"评测集","eval_evaluation_set_coze":"Coze默认评测集","eval_evaluation_set_limit":"最多可上传 5 个评测集文件","eval_evaluation_task_terminated":"评测任务已终止","eval_evaluation_use_case":"评测集","eval_executing":"执行中","eval_execution_case_status":"执行用例情况","eval_execution_start_time":"执行开始时间","eval_expand_more":"展开更多","eval_expected_output":"预期输出","eval_expected_remaining_time":"预计剩余时间","eval_input":"输入","eval_input_token":"输入Tokens","eval_knowledge_evaluation":"知识评测","eval_learn_more":"了解详情","eval_load_failed_please_retry":"加载失败,请 重试","eval_max_agents_limit":"最多只能选择 {num} 个智能体","eval_memory_evaluation":"记忆评测","eval_metrics":"指标","eval_multi_turn":"多轮对话","eval_no_assessment_history":"暂无评测历史","eval_no_assessment_score":"暂无评测得分","eval_no_data_found":"未查询到数据","eval_no_permission":"评测需要此 Agent 编辑权限，请联系空间管理员开通","eval_no_results":"无相关结果","eval_no_scoring_mode":"不使用裁判模型。仅批量运行智能体并收集输出结果。","eval_not_current_version":"非当前版本","eval_object_version":"版本","eval_output_token":"输出Tokens","eval_please_retry":"请重试","eval_query_type":"查询类型","eval_quick_evaluation":"快速评测","eval_rating_and_result":"Duration & Tokens ","eval_reference_output":"预期正确输出(Reference output)\\n1. 目的：提供标准答案，用于评估模型输出的质量和准确性\\n2. 填写要求：可以为空\\n3. 值类型：文本\\n4. 输出规则：  \\n  1. 作为评估模型输出的参考标准\\n  2. 可用于自动化测试和质量评估","eval_resource_consumption":"预估评测成本消耗","eval_restart_Evaluation":"重新开始评测","eval_restart_assessment":"重新开始评测","eval_retry":"重新评测","eval_rule_details":"规则详情","eval_rules":"规则","eval_runtime_exception":"运行异常","eval_session_id":"会话ID","eval_session_number":"会话编号 (Session)-必填\\n1. 目的：组织多轮对话\\n2. 格式类型：必须为纯数字\\n3. 填写规则：  \\n  1. 相同编号的行属于同一会话\\n  2. 不同编号开启新会话\\n  3. 空白单元格自动继承上一个非空编号，表示属于同一会话","eval_single_turn":"单轮对话","eval_skill_evaluation":"技能评测","eval_start_download_results":"开始下载评测结果","eval_start_time":"开始时间","eval_status_referenced":"已引用","eval_step_data_preparation":"准备评测数据","eval_step_rule_writing":"设置评测规则","eval_step_select_object":"选择评测对象\\n","eval_stop_running":"停止运行","eval_stopped":"已停止","eval_submitted_at":"提交于","eval_system_prompt":"系统提示词 (System prompt)-必填\\n1. 目的：设定模型的角色和行为规范，确保对话的一致性和目标性\\n2. 填写要求：必填\\n3. 格式类型：文本\\n4. 填写规则：  \\n  1. 会话内首次出现的系统提示词将应用于整个会话\\n  2. 同一会话中后续行的提示词可留空\\n  3. 空白单元格自动使用该会话首次出现的系统提示词","eval_task_id":"任务ID","eval_terminate_assessment":"终止评测","eval_testrun_actual_output":"实际输出","eval_token_consumption_input":"输入","eval_token_consumption_output":"输出","eval_token_consumption_total":"总计","eval_token_cost":"Token 耗费","eval_trigger_person":"触发人","eval_unable_to_continue_after_interruption":"中断后无法继续运行","eval_unknown_error_occurred":"发生未知错误","eval_user_chat_scenario_evaluation":"用户闲聊场景的用户评估","eval_user_input":"用户输入(User prompt)-必填\\n1. 目的：记录用户实际输入内容，作为模型响应的直接触发点\\n2. 填写要求：必须填写，不能为空\\n3. 格式类型：文本","eval_userguide_tips":"开始评测","eval_variable_undefined_tip":"此变量未定义，请检查变量名。","eval_version_beta":"草稿版","eval_version_official":"正式版","eval_view_evaluation_details":"查看评估详情","eval_view_results":"查看结果","eval_vocal_consumption":"火山点数","eval_vs_previous_evaluation":"与上次评估对比","evaluate_form_vailate_error":"无法保存，因为必填项未填写或存在内容报错","evaluate_rule_deleted_success":"规则删除成功","evaluation1_action":"操作\\n","evaluation1_action_continue":"继续","evaluation1_action_delete":"删除","evaluation1_action_feedback":"一键反馈","evaluation1_action_pause":"暂停","evaluation1_action_retry":"重试\\n","evaluation1_action_start":"开始","evaluation1_action_view_results":"查看结果\\n","evaluation1_balance":"已上传 {caseCount} 个评测案例，预计消耗 {tokenCount} 个 token