uation1_title":"效果评测","evaluation1_token_consumption":"Token消耗\\n","evaluation1_tokens_consumption":"Token用量","evaluation1_total_consumption":"资源消耗","evaluation1_upload_area_text":"点击上传或拖拽文件至此处","evaluation1_upload_data_set":"上传我的数据\\n","evaluation1_upload_instruction":"请使用模板上传，支持EXCEL、CSV格式，最多5个文件","evaluation1_use_dataset":"使用\\n","evaluation1_user_guide":"新手必看\\n","evaluation1_warning_message":"您当前的余额不足，可能无法完成整个评测过程。继续评测可能导致：\\n\\n1. 评测中途中断\\n2. 结果不完整\\n3. 资源浪费\\n\\n建议先充值后再进行评测。","evaluation1_warning_message_eval_prompt":"警告：评测规则缺少 {field} 字段引用，影响评分模型功能。继续评测将导致：1. 仅执行评测对象（智能体 / 工作流 / 模型）2. 收集输出结果 3. 无法进行自动评分  是否确认继续？\\n","evaluation1_welcome":"欢迎来到扣子评测，让我们开始吧！\\n","evaluation_action":"操作","evaluation_action_copy":"复制","evaluation_action_delete":"删除","evaluation_action_download":"下载","evaluation_autosaved":"自动保存于 {savedtime}","evaluation_cancel":"取消","evaluation_case_AIGenerate":"AI 生成","evaluation_case_AIGenerate_number":"生成几组数据？","evaluation_case_action_report":"用例运行结果","evaluation_case_action_run":"运行用例","evaluation_case_addRule":"添加规则","evaluation_case_autoTestData_tip":"根据当前智能体的 PROMPT 描述和配置的技能自动生成，可以根据您的需求进行编辑","evaluation_case_clickCreate":"点击按钮创建用例","evaluation_case_closeAndSave":"关闭并保存","evaluation_case_continueConfiguration":"保存并继续配置","evaluation_case_continue_error":"当前用例的配置状态无法运行，请进入编辑用例页面完成用例的配置","evaluation_case_create":"创建用例","evaluation_case_dataset_configuration":"评测数据设置","evaluation_case_defaultRules":"默认规则","evaluation_case_delete_confirm":"确认删除此用例","evaluation_case_description_hint":"请输入用例描述","evaluation_case_edit":"编辑用例","evaluation_case_empty":"暂无用例","evaluation_case_evaluationMode":"评测模式","evaluation_case_evaluationMode_advanced":"高级模式","evaluation_case_evaluationMode_automation":"自动模式","evaluation_case_import_error_pupup":"导入数据时出现错误。请检查并修改后再导入","evaluation_case_importing":"导入中，请等待","evaluation_case_inputRequired":"Input 字段必填","evaluation_case_manualRating_tips":"选择人工评分时评分规则不会生效，需要在评测用例运行完成后，在评测报告进行人工评分","evaluation_case_name_hint":"请输入用例名称"