":"上下文内容","model_config_generate_advance":"高级设置","model_config_generate_balance":"平衡模式","model_config_generate_creative":"创意模式","model_config_generate_customize":"自定义","model_config_generate_explain":"**精确模式**: \\n\\n- 严格遵循指令生成内容\\n- 适用于需准确无误的场合，如正式文档、代码等\\n\\n**平衡模式**: \\n\\n- 在创新和精确之间寻求平衡\\n- 适用于大多数日常应用场景，生成有趣但不失严谨的内容\\n\\n**创意模式**: \\n\\n- 激发创意，提供新颖独特的想法\\n- 适合需要灵感和独特观点的场景，如头脑风暴、创意写作等\\n\\n**自定义模式**: \\n\\n- 通过高级设置，自定义生成方式\\n- 根据需求，进行精细调整，实现个性化优化","model_config_generate_precise":"精确模式","model_config_history":"对话历史策略","model_config_history_json":"JSON","model_config_history_markdown":"Markdown","model_config_history_round":"携带上下文轮数","model_config_history_round_explain":"设置带入模型上下文的对话历史轮数。轮数越多，多轮对话的相关性越高，但消耗的 Token 也越多。","model_config_history_text":"文本","model_config_history_tool_full":"完整工具返回值","model_config_history_tool_trunct":"超过 200 Token 截断","model_config_max_length":"最大回复长度","model_config_max_length_explain":"可控制模型回复的最多 Token 数量，以满足不同场景和需求。通常 100 Tokens 约等于 60 个中文汉字。","model_config_mode1":"工具模式 I","model_config_mode2":"工具模式 II","model_config_mode3":"工具模式 III","model_config_mode_explain_content_llm_process":"LLM 思考过程","model_config_mode_explain_content_llm_response":"最终回复","model_config_mode_explain_content_query":"用户消息","model_config_mode_explain_content_tool":"工具返回值","model_config_mode_explain_context_mode":"上下文模式","model_config_mode_explain_title":"用户每发送一条消息，智能体都会将历史信息中的用户Query、LLM 思考过程、工具返回值、LLM 回复内容，加入上下文当中。不同模式下包含的信息量不同，信息越完整，智能体回复时的上下文就越连贯，但同时占用的 Token 数量也越多。","model_config_mode_explain_tool_response":"工具响应","model_config_model":"模型","model_config_precise":"精准模式","model_config_random":"随机","model_config_response_format":"输出格式","model_config_response_format_explain":"- **文本**: 使用普通文本格式回复\\n- **Markdown**: 将引导模型使用Markdown格式输出回复\\n- **JSON**: 将引导模型使用JSON格式输出","model_config_temperature":"生成随机性","model_config_temperature_explain":"- **temperature**: 调高温度会使得模型的输出更多样性和创新性，反之，降低温度会使输出内容更加遵循指令要求但减少多样性。建议不要与“Top p”同时调整。","model_config_title":"模型设置","model_configuration":"模型配置\\n","model_confirgure_to_workspace_tool_tip":"点击配置到当前工作空间","model_context_cache_bank_prompt_tips":"开启模型前缀缓存时，提示词库功能暂不可用","model_context_cache_functioncall_desc":"开启前缀缓存后不支持技能调用","model_context_cache_on_confirm_pop_button_cancel":"取消","model_context_cache_on_confirm_pop_button_confirm":"开启","model_context_cache_on_confirm_pop_cons1":"将不支持function call/工具调用","model_context_cache_on_confirm_pop_cons2":"不支持配置模型默认参数，如今日时间等，需自行写在变量系统提示词中","model_context_cache_on_confirm_pop_pros1":"模型响应速度提升","model_context_cache_on_confirm_pop_pros2":"若命中缓存，命中缓存的token成本降低","model_context_cache_on_confirm_pop_title":"是否开启前缀缓存？","model_context_cache_on_prompt_compare_tips":"开启模型前缀缓存时，调试词对比功能暂不可用","model_context_cache_optmize_prompt_tips":"开启模型前缀缓存时，自动优化提示词功能暂不可用","model_context_cache_submit_prompt_tips":"开启模型前缀缓存时，提交到提示词库功能暂不可用","model_context_cache_verify_variables_tips":"前缀缓存提示词不能包含变量或技能","model_deploy_capability_tooltip":"若模型支持对应能力，请在此处配置，否则无法正常使用。","model_deploy_content_moderation_tooltip":"自定义接入的模型将使用对应的内容安全策略。","model_deploy_model_edit_detailpage_API_type":"API协议","model_deploy_model_edit_detailpage_API_type_1":"OpenAI Chat/completion API协议","model_deploy_model_edit_detailpage_API_type_2":"OpenAI response API（暂不支持）","model_deploy_model_edit_detailpage_capability":"模型能力","model_deploy_model_edit_detailpage_capability_audio_understand":"音频理解","model_deploy_model_edit_detailpage_capability_continue":"续写","model_deploy_model_edit_detailpage_capability_cot":"深度思考","model_deploy_model_edit_detailpage_capability_fc":"工具调用","model_deploy_model_edit_detailpage_capability_img_understand":"图片理解","model_deploy_model_edit_detailpage_capability_video_understand":"视频理解","model_deploy_model_edit_detailpage_content_moderation":"内容安全护栏","model_deploy_model_edit_detailpage_content_moderation_default":"默认方案","model_deploy_model_edit_detailpage_content_moderation_enterprise":"企业自定义方案（敬请期待）","model_deploy_model_edit_detailpage_context_length":"模型上下文长度","model_deploy_model_edit_detailpage_cust