nding_eino_getstart":"GitHub","new_landing_eino_selling_point1_description":"Eino 将 AI 应用开发中常见的能力抽象为组件","new_landing_eino_selling_point1_description2":"统一的定义让 AI 应用能力变得简单清晰每种组件抽象都有多种实现，开箱即用","new_landing_eino_selling_point1_linkname":"更多信息","new_landing_eino_selling_point1_title":"统一的组件抽象和丰富的实现","new_landing_eino_selling_point2_description":"提供 Graph、Chain、Workflow 多种编排模式，强大且灵活","new_landing_eino_selling_point2_description2":"用简单的方式表达复杂的业务逻辑编排中还提供了类型检查、并发管理、切面管理、可扩展的 Option 能力","new_landing_eino_selling_point2_title":"灵活的编排能力","new_landing_eino_selling_point3_description":"根据输入和输出是否为流，组成4种请求交互模式：invoke、stream、collect、transform","new_landing_eino_selling_point3_description2":"Eino 提供了流的自动转换、流的合并、流的复制等能力","new_landing_eino_selling_point3_title":"完善的流处理能力","new_landing_eino_selling_point4_description":"可视化的编排和调试工具，拖拽几下就可以完成一个AI应用构建，AI应用开发原来可以如此简单","new_landing_eino_selling_point4_title":"强大的工具链","new_landing_eino_slogan":"Eino 框架","new_landing_eino_slogan2":"Agent 开发从未如此简单","new_landing_eino_slogan_button_get_start":"快速开始","new_landing_eino_tips_describe":"Golang AI 应用开发框架","new_landing_eino_tips_title":"Eino","new_landing_footer_button_get_start":"立即免费试用","new_landing_getstart":"登录扣子","new_landing_loop":"调试工具","new_landing_loop_tips_description":"让 Agent 开发调优不再迷航","new_landing_loop_tips_title":"扣子罗盘","new_landing_opensource":"代码开源","new_landing_opensource_slogan_1":"拥抱开源","new_landing_opensource_slogan_2":"释放智能体无限潜能","new_landing_return_customers":"返回客户案例","new_landing_selling_point1_description":"可视化界面，拖拽式操作，主流大语言模型即连即用，开发效率瞬间提升","new_landing_selling_point1_img_description1":"便捷开发提示词 / 超多大模型开放体验","new_landing_selling_point1_img_description2":"一键添加节点，直观灵活的工作流编排","new_landing_selling_point1_img_description3":"UI Builder-拖拽组件快速搭建用户界面","new_landing_selling_point1_title":"零代码打造 AI 爆款应用","new_landing_selling_point2_description":"内置专业调试环境，运行效果实时预览，搭配详细日志分析，精准定位问题根源，为 AI 开发提供可靠保障","new_landing_selling_point2_title":"零延迟调试，所见即所得","new_landing_selling_point3_description":"点击一下