hed_title_record":"录制完成！点击按钮","project_library_voice_add_finished_title_start":"开始复刻！","project_library_voice_add_finished_title_upload":"上传完成！点击按钮","project_library_voice_add_icon":"图标","project_library_voice_add_language":"语言","project_library_voice_add_listen_confirm":"确认","project_library_voice_add_listen_content":"音色试听","project_library_voice_add_listen_content_cn":"扣子是新一代 AI 应用开发平台。无论你是否有编程基础，都可以快速搭建出各种应用和智能体，并一键发布到各大社交平台，或者轻松部署到自己的网站","project_library_voice_add_listen_content_en":"Coze is a new generation AI application development platform. Whether you have a programming background or not, you can quickly build various applications and agents, and publish them to major social platforms with one click, or easily deploy them to your own website.","project_library_voice_add_listen_content_es":"Coze es una plataforma de desarrollo de aplicaciones de IA de nueva generaci\xf3n. Ya tengas conocimientos de programaci\xf3n o no, puedes crear r\xe1pidamente diversas aplicaciones y agentes, y publicarlos en las principales plataformas sociales con un solo clic, o desplegarlos f\xe1cilmente en tu propio sitio web.","project_library_voice_add_listen_content_id":"Coze adalah platform pengembangan aplikasi AI generasi baru. Apakah Anda memiliki latar belakang pemrograman atau tidak, Anda dapat dengan cepat membangun berbagai aplikasi dan agen, dan mempublikasikannya ke platform sosial utama dengan satu klik, atau dengan mudah menerapkannya ke situs web Anda sendiri.","project_library_voice_add_listen_content_ja":"Coze は新世代の AI アプリケーション開発プラットフォームです。プログラミングの知識があるかどうかに関係なく、さまざまなアプリケーションやエージェントを迅速に構築し、ワンクリックで主要なソーシャルプラットフォームに公開するか、簡単に自分のウェブサイトに展開することができます。","project_library_voice_add_listen_content_pt":"Coze \xe9 uma plataforma de desenvolvimento de aplicativos de IA de nova gera\xe7\xe3o. Quer voc\xea tenha ou n\xe3o conhecimento de programa\xe7\xe3o, pode criar rapidamente v\xe1rios aplicativos e agentes, e public\xe1-los nas principais plataformas sociais com um clique, ou implant\xe1-los facilmente em seu pr\xf3prio site.","project_library_voice_add_listen_content_zh":"扣子是新一代 AI 应用开发平台。无论你是否有编程基础，都可以快速搭建出各种应用和智能体，并一键发布到各大社交平台，或者轻松部署到自己的网站","project_library_voice_add_listen_generate_text":"合成","project_library_voice_add_listen_generate_title":"输入文本，合成声音","project_library_voice_add_listen_re_replicatex":"重新复刻","project_library_voice_add_listen_title":"复刻成功！试听声音","project_library_voice_add_name":"音色名称","project_library_voice_add_name_placeholder":"输入音色名称","project_library_voice_add_record_content":"扣子，如时光的针脚，缝缀着岁月的衣衫。一颗扣子，一段故事，串联起生活的温暖与诗意。","project_library_voice_add_record_content_cn":"扣子，如时光的针脚，缝缀着岁月的衣衫。一颗扣子，一段故事，锁住那些珍贵的记忆，在细微处低语，串联起生活的温暖与诗意。","project_library_voice_add_record_content_en":"Coze, like the gentle whispers of the breeze, caresses the moments of our lives\' ease. A coze, a chapter of tales untold, weaving the fabric of friendship\'s gold.","project_library_voice_add_record_content_es":"Coze, como hilos del tiempo, teje nuestros d\xedas. Un amigo fiel, guarda historias y susurra memorias. En cada detalle, conecta la calidez y la poes\xeda de la vida. Coze est\xe1 siempre contigo, en cada paso y en cada risa.","project_library_voice_add_record_content_id":"Coze, seperti jahitan waktu, menyulam hari-hari kita. Teman setia, mengunci cerita dan kenangan berharga. Dalam setiap detail, menghubungkan kehangatan dan keindahan hidup.","project_library_voice_add_record_content_ja":"Coze、そよ風のように、日々の安らぎを包み込む。Coze、友達のように寄り添い、友情の物語を紡ぐ。","project_library_voice_add_record_content_pt":"Coze, como pontos do tempo, costura nossos dias. Um amigo leal, guarda hist\xf3rias e sussurra mem\xf3rias. Em cada detalhe, conecta o calor e a poesia da vida.","project_library_voice_add_record_content_zh":"扣子，如时光的针脚，缝缀着岁月的衣衫。一颗扣子，一段故事，锁住那些珍贵的记忆，在细微处低语，串联起生活的温暖与诗意。","project_library_voice_add_record_end":"结束录制","project_library_voice_add_record_time":"录音中（{time}s）","project_library_voice_add_record_title":"请大声朗读以下文案","project_library_voice_add_start_content":"推荐上传或录制10-30s音频，上传支持小于8M的wav、mp3、m4a格式文件。\\n避免多人对话、明显杂音、噪音、混响等情况。","project_library_voice_add_start_record":"开始录制","project_library_voice_add_start_title":"录制或上传音频进行复刻","project_library_voice_add_start_upload":"上传音频","project_library_voice_add_title":"创建音色","project_library_voice_add_toast_create_fail":"创建失败","project_library_voice_add_toast_microphone_fail":"启动录音失败，请检查是否开启麦克风权限","project_library_voice_add_toast_ordinary":"升级扣子专业版，抢先体验音色克隆和更多语音功能","project_library_voice_add_toast_professional":"音色克隆还在测试阶段 (通过OpenAPI克隆音色已上线，单价138/个)，需要请填写申请：","project_library_voice_add_toast_professional_link":"申请链接","project_library_voice_add_toast_update_fail":"更新失败","project_library_voice_delete_cancel":"取消","project_library_voice_delete_confirm":"删除","project_library_voice_delete_content":"删除后不可恢复","project_library_voice_delete_title":"删除音色？","project_library_voice_detail_chances":"剩余复刻次数","project_library_voice_detail_creator":"创建人","project_library_voice_detail_language":"语言","project_library_voice_detail_latest_time":"最近复刻时间","project_library_voice_detail_null_button":"开始复刻","project_library_voice_detail_null_content":"点击下方按钮立即开始复刻声音","project_library_voice_detail_null_title":"暂无声音","project_library_voice_detail_re_replicate":"重新复刻","project_library_voice_detail_re_replicate_no_chances":"剩余复刻次数已用完","project_library_voice_detail_time":"创建时间","project_library_voice_detail_voice_id":"音色 ID","project_library_voice_tag_not_replicated":"未复刻","project_library_voice_toast_":"音色敏感，请重新提交","project_library_voice_toast_inappropriate":"音色敏感，请重新提交","project_library_voice_toast_longer":"音频时长需要大于10s","project_library_voice_toast_record_fail":"复刻失败，未检测到人声","project_library_voice_toast_un_found":"未获取到内容，请重新录制","project_library_voice_toast_upload_fail":"上传失败，请重试","project_library_voice_toast_upload_large":"文件大小不可超过8M","project_library_voice_toast_verify_fail":"校验失败，请按照文本朗读","project_library_voice_update_title":"更新音色","project_permission_collaborator_1":"邀请协作者","project_permission_collaborator_2":"目前为0.5 beta 版本，不支持在应用下多人共同编辑1个画布，添加为协作者后，协作者仅支持创建/编辑自己的画布。协作者没有应用的发布权限，仅应用创建者可发布。","project_permission_collaborator_3":"移除后该协作者所创建的资源及编辑权限将转移给项目创建人。","project_permission_collaborator_noteditor_tooltip":"暂不支持编辑他人创建的资源","project_permission_collaborator_search":"输入用户名或昵称进行检索","project_plugin_delete_modal_description":"请谨慎操作，删除后不可恢复","project_plugin_delete_modal_title":"确认删除 {pluginName} ？\\n\\n","project_plugin_delete_success_toast":"插件删除成功","project_plugin_setup_metadata_cancel":"取消","project_plugin_setup_metadata_edit":"编辑","project_plugin_setup_metadata_more_info":"更多信息\\n","project_plugin_setup_metadata_save":" 保存","project_plugin_testrun":"试运行","project_publish_select_desc_compliance_new":"在以下平台发布你的应用，即表示你已充分理解并同意遵循{publish_terms_title}（包括但不限于任何隐私政策、社区指南、数据处理协议等）。","project_release":"发布","project_release_API":"API","project_release_Please_select":"请选择 Chatflow","project_release_already_released":"已成功提交发布","project_release_already_released_desc":"发布过程可以关闭本页面，发布状态可以在应用详情页查看","project_release_api1":"API 或 SDK","project_release_api_desc":"仅创建过工作流的应用支持该发布方式；在发布前请先创建个人访问令牌。","project_release_api_sdk":"发布为 API 或 SDK","project_release_api_sdk_desc":"将应用中的工作流发布为 API 或将对话流发布为 SDK ，嵌入到你自己的应用中。","project_release_cancel":"撤销发布","project_release_cancel1":"撤销发布？","project_release_cancel1_desc":"已发布的当前应用将失效","project_release_cancel2":"解除","project_release_cancel_invalid":"已经发布到该渠道的项目将失效","project_release_channel":"渠道审核与发布","project_release_channel_reason_tooltip":"点击后自动下载文件","project_release_chatflow1":"请先在应用中添加对话流","project_release_chatflow2":"处理消息的对话流","project_release_chatflow3":"对话流已被删除，请重新选择","project_release_chatflow4":"请先选择处理消息的对话流","project_release_chatflow_choose":"处理消息的对话流","project_release_chatflow_desc":"当用户在三方平台发送消息时，将调用该对话流来接收用户消息。应用中所有配置的消息输出节点，均会回复给用户。","project_release_chatflow_desc2":"当用户在第三方平台发送消息时，将调用该对话流来接收用户消息。应用中所有配置的消息输出节点，均会回复给用户。","project_release_choose_oauth":"请选择 OAuth App","project_release_code_desc":"代码打包中，打包完成会展示下载链接并发送系统通知","project_release_