板","project_release_illegal4":"应用的所有UI页面都没有绑定工作流，请绑定>=1个后重试","project_release_illegal5":"审核不通过，请检查渠道发布规范后重试。","project_release_illegal6":"应用头像含有违禁信息","project_release_illegal7":"应用名称含有违禁信息","project_release_illegal8":"应用描述含有违禁信息","project_release_illegal9":"应用中的工作流含有违禁信息","project_release_in_audit_progress":"发布渠道正在审核中，请稍候","project_release_in_progress":"进行中","project_release_miniprogram":"发布到小程序","project_release_miniprogram1":"小程序","project_release_miniprogram_desc_release":"查看正式版","project_release_miniprogram_desc_test":"查看体验版","project_release_no_chatflow":"暂无对话流","project_release_no_oauth":"暂无 OAuth app","project_release_no_oauth_app":"请选择OAuth App","project_release_no_oauth_app_desc":"私有发布需要通过OAuth App进行发布，请先创建OAuth App","project_release_not_pass":"未通过","project_release_notify":"如果应用没有经过完整的试运行，可能发布结果不合预期。建议经过完整的试运行后再进行发布。","project_release_oauth_desc":"私有发布通过 OAuth app 进行发布，请先创建 OAuth app","project_release_open_in_store":"立即使用","project_release_pack_fail_reason":"以下资源打包失败，请检查后再试：","project_release_pack_fail_wf_check":"{name} 工作流校验未通过 ","project_release_pack_fail_wf_check_detail":"查看详情","project_release_package":"应用打包","project_release_package_failed":"打包失败","project_release_package_failed_reason":"{package_failed_reason}","project_release_package_wrong":"以下资源打包失败，请检查后再试","project_release_pass":"通过","project_release_reason_channel":"{reason_channel}","project_release_release_open":"公开发布","project_release_sdk":"聊天SDK","project_release_sdk_open_desc":"对所有可访问你的 Web 端人员可用","project_release_sdk_option1":"私有发布","project_release_sdk_option_desc1":"仅限定的用户可使用，需通过登录账号等方式进行身份验证，节约成本","project_release_select_chatflow":"请选择工作流","project_release_select_oauth":"请选择 OAuth app","project_release_selected":"已选","project_release_set":"配置","project_release_set_desc":"请先配置/授权","project_release_social":"发布到通讯或社交平台","project_release_social1":"社交平台","project_release_social_desc":"将对话流一键发布到微信、抖音等三方社交平台。","project_release_social_desc1":"将对话流一键发布到社交平台。\\n需要选择接收用户消息的对话流。当用户在社交平台发送消息时，将调用该对话