他成员可见，成员间会以昵称相互称呼","scene_edit_roles_create_member_reselect_button":"重新选择","scene_edit_roles_create_member_reserve":"预留一个空位","scene_edit_roles_create_member_select_bot":"选择智能体","scene_edit_roles_create_member_select_button":"选择","scene_edit_roles_create_member_tooltip":"你可以给角色指派一个智能体，任何用户运行场景时，此角色都由这个被指派的智能体扮演。\\n你也可以给角色预留一个空位，预留的空位需要在场景运行时手动添加。不同用户运行场景时，这个角色可以由不同的智能体扮演，也可以由用户自己扮演。\\n","scene_edit_roles_create_name":"角色名称","scene_edit_roles_create_name_hide":"只对主持人和自己可见","scene_edit_roles_create_name_open":"对所有人可见","scene_edit_roles_create_name_placeholder":"请输入角色名称","scene_edit_roles_create_title":"创建角色","scene_edit_roles_create_visibility":"角色可见性","scene_edit_roles_delete_popup_button_delete":"删除","scene_edit_roles_delete_popup_subtitle":"此操作不可撤销","scene_edit_roles_delete_popup_title":"确认删除角色吗？","scene_edit_roles_edit_title":"编辑角色","scene_edit_roles_host_edit_name":"主持人名称","scene_edit_roles_host_edit_title":"编辑主持人","scene_edit_roles_host_introduction":"作为主持人,你需要调度场景中的成员们发言。","scene_edit_roles_host_name_default":"Host","scene_edit_roles_host_placeholder":"请详细描述当前场景中各个角色的发言顺序和规则逻辑。当开始运行时， 主持人会按照此规则来调度所有角色的发言。","scene_edit_roles_list_nickname_empty_seat":"空位","scene_edit_roles_nickname_duplicate":"添加失败，场景中存在重复的角色昵称","scene_edit_roles_nickname_verify":"只能包含数字、字母、下划线","scene_edit_roles_reserve_add_member_onself_description":"你可以将自己作为成员加入场景","scene_edit_roles_reserve_add_member_selected":"已选择：","scene_edit_roles_reserve_add_member_subtitle":"需要添加 {n} 位成员到场景中","scene_edit_roles_reserve_add_member_title":"添加成员","scene_edit_roles_reserve_complete_member_bot_sign":"智能体","scene_edit_roles_reserve_complete_member_oneself_sign":"当前用户","scene_edit_roles_reserve_complete_member_title":"完善成员基础信息","scene_edit_roles_title":"角色配置","scene_edit_roles_tooltip_delete":"删除","scene_edit_roles_tooltip_edit":"编辑","scene_edit_roles_tooltip_jump_to_bot":"查看智能体详情","scene_edit_roles_view_title":"查看角色","scene_edit_rules_placeholder":"描述当前场景的背景和规则，以让所有角色理解自己身处的场景。当开始运行时，这段信息会同步给场景中的所有角色。","scene_